by day under OGL, rate-limited to 1 request/s. It explicitly says DfT
itself does not maintain a public raw archive. NDL also reports known
outage gaps and says its current server has ~46 days of storage left.
Separately, NDL says a University of Exeter BODS archive goes back to
February 2024 (~5 TB). Therefore POW should NOT spend moat effort
duplicating national raw BODS. The moat is the causal join Street
Manager event/version =E2=86=92 affected journey exposure =E2=86=92 degrada=
tion =E2=86=92
recovery, plus preserving the derived exposure/outcome tape and
